Error [jet.ConcurrentCaptureNotOwned]: `values[…]` cannot be passed with write access while `edit` is lent to a task in `g`
  --> named_write_window_call_preserves_scoped_loan_rejection.jet:11:15
    |
 11 |         bump(&edit)
    |               ^^^^
 Why: A task.group joins its children at the end of the block, so `edit` stays borrowed until `g` joins — changing `values[…]` now would race a running task or free memory it still reads
 Fix: Do this after the `g` block ends, give it with `^`, freeze it with `freeze`, or share it with `shared`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1101
